# Code owners for ReadyNow
#
# Listed owners are requested for review automatically when a PR touches a
# matching path. The last matching pattern wins, so ordering matters.
#
# SETUP REQUIRED: the team below must exist in the
# Human-Rights-First-Innovation-Lab org and have write access to this
# repository. If it does not, GitHub silently ignores every rule in this file —
# there is no warning. Create the team, or replace @.../readynow-maintainers
# with individual @usernames throughout.
#
# To make these reviews mandatory rather than merely requested, enable
# "Require review from Code Owners" in the branch protection rules for
# `develop` and `main`.

# Default: anything not matched below.
*                                   @Human-Rights-First-Innovation-Lab/readynow-maintainers

# --- Areas with non-obvious constraints (see CONTRIBUTING.md) ---

# Twilio Functions run against production and handle real phone numbers. Older
# endpoint URLs are compiled into app bundles already on users' phones, and the
# app has no over-the-air update mechanism: changing a request format breaks
# people who cannot update.
/twilio/                            @Human-Rights-First-Innovation-Lab/readynow-maintainers

# Authenticated encryption with no plaintext fallback, by design.
/app/utils/encryption-utils.ts      @Human-Rights-First-Innovation-Lab/readynow-maintainers

# Opt-in, with all personal data scrubbed. New fields need discussion.
/app/utils/crash-reporting.ts       @Human-Rights-First-Innovation-Lab/readynow-maintainers

# The alert send path must never report success on a failed send.
/app/components/AlertButton.tsx     @Human-Rights-First-Innovation-Lab/readynow-maintainers

# --- Project governance, security posture and build integrity ---

/SECURITY.md                        @Human-Rights-First-Innovation-Lab/readynow-maintainers
/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md                 @Human-Rights-First-Innovation-Lab/readynow-maintainers
/CONTRIBUTING.md                    @Human-Rights-First-Innovation-Lab/readynow-maintainers
/LICENSE                            @Human-Rights-First-Innovation-Lab/readynow-maintainers
/NOTICE                             @Human-Rights-First-Innovation-Lab/readynow-maintainers
/DCO.md                             @Human-Rights-First-Innovation-Lab/readynow-maintainers
/.github/                           @Human-Rights-First-Innovation-Lab/readynow-maintainers

